--- !u!114 &-6162968710350654564
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 21
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: EQ_V.1/21
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: "\xC9dgar se retira./nEl pueblo no conf\xEDa en \xC9dgar. Aplauden tu decisi\xF3n./nTe
    sientes bien."
  childrenIDs: []
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 3142
    y: 195
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 0
  RepPuebloCost: 0
  SobornoCost: 0
--- !u!114 &-5479863186532076609
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 9
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: EQ_V.1/9
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: "De toda clase./nVeamos.../nTengo pociones, remedios caseros, joyas, poemas.../nIncluso
    acepto encargos espec\xEDficos de ciertos clientes./nEl \xFAltimo que acept\xE9
    era de una mujer que pidi\xF3 algo para mantenerse joven./nCreo que no era de
    Castroviejo; nunca antes la hab\xEDa visto."
  childrenIDs:
  - EQ_V.1/11
  - 11
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 1741
    y: 45
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 0
  RepPuebloCost: 0
  SobornoCost: 0
--- !u!114 &-3775436289609104179
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 19
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: EQ_V.1/19
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: "Por supuesto./nAqu\xED tiene./nA cambio de este favor, la pr\xF3xima vez
    te ofrecer\xE9 art\xEDculos exclusivos."
  childrenIDs:
  - EQ_V.1/23
  - 23
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 2794
    y: 594
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 0
  RepPuebloCost: 0
  SobornoCost: 0
