--- !u!114 &-1535382868516748248
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 11
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: EQ_V.1/11
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: "Aseguro a mis clientes que mis productos har\xE1n realidad su sue\xF1os./nPor
    ello, tengo fama de fraude y charlat\xE1n./nSin embargo, a veces mi palabrer\xEDa
    se cumple./nAunque no de la manera deseada.../nPero jam\xE1s vender\xEDa algo
    sabiendo su peligrosidad."
  childrenIDs:
  - EQ_V.1/12
  - EQ_V.1/13
  - EQ_V.1/14
  - EQ_V.1/15
  - 12
  - 13
  - 14
  - 15
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 2091
    y: 186
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 0
  RepPuebloCost: 0
  SobornoCost: 0
--- !u!114 &-1264869952438393154
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 20
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: EQ_V.1/20
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: "\xC9dgar se retira./nLa iglesia aprueba la penitencia impuesta para expiar
    sus pecados."
  childrenIDs: []
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 3133
    y: -1
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 0
  RepPuebloCost: 0
  SobornoCost: 0
--- !u!114 &-790863752555174941
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: EQ_V.1/1
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: "Estoy muy preocupado, padre./nLos rumores sobre el colgante maldito son
    cada vez m\xE1s fuertes./nY muchos ya empiezan a creer que yo tengo algo que
    ver./nSi no consigo limpiar mi nombre, mi negocio se hundir\xE1."
  childrenIDs:
  - EQ_V.1/2
  - EQ_V.1/3
  - 2
  - 3
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 4
    y: 1
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 0
  RepPuebloCost: 0
  SobornoCost: 0
--- !u!114 &-76339004535986951
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 4
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: EQ_V.1/4
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: "Por supuesto que no./nNo vendo mis art\xEDculos a mocosos./nTampoco es que
    tengan con qu\xE9 pag\xE9rmelos..."
  childrenIDs:
  - EQ_V.1/6
  - 6
