--- !u!114 &1311353264561978814
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 5
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: EQ_V.1/5
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: "Est\xE1s bien enterado./nEn mis viajes, recolecto objetos extra\xF1os y
    curiosos que luego vendo en los pueblos./nQu\xE9 quiere que le diga, as\xED me
    gano yo el pan."
  childrenIDs:
  - EQ_V.1/6
  - 6
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 692
    y: 250
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 0
  RepPuebloCost: 0
  SobornoCost: 0
--- !u!114 &2782081040366247644
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 14
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: EQ_V.1/14
  isPlayerSpeaking: 1
  text: "Absoluci\xF3n: Quiz\xE1 utilices el enga\xF1o, pero intentas que las vidas
    de los dem\xE1s sean felices."
  childrenIDs:
  - EQ_V.1/18
  - 18
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 2442
    y: 393
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: -1
  RepIglesiaCost: 1
  RepPuebloCost: 0
  SobornoCost: 0
--- !u!114 &2866835249923897698
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 17
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: EQ_V.1/17
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: "\xA1Rayos!/nHe de huir antes de que arruine del todo mi negocio./nPero que
    te quede claro que, en mi \xFAltimo paso por el pueblo, pienso decirles a todos
    lo poco confiable que eres."
  childrenIDs:
  - EQ_V.1/21
  - 21
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 2795
    y: 193
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 0
  RepPuebloCost: 0
  SobornoCost: 0
--- !u!114 &3461317296923011000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 16
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: EQ_V.1/16
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: "AhahaAHAHAH.../nAl final, hasta t\xFA buscas c\xF3mo sacar tajada./nPadre,
    creo que t\xFA y yo podr\xEDamos llevarnos muy bien./nSin embargo, soy un charlat\xE1n./nNo
    s\xE9 hacer otra cosa; no puedo hacer lo que me pide."
  childrenIDs:
  - EQ_V.1/20
  - 20
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 2792
    y: -6
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 0
  RepPuebloCost: 0
  SobornoCost: 0
--- !u!114 &3834380306275576588
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 6
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: EQ_V.1/6
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: "Y ahora mi negocio se va a la mierda./nHe intentado vender mis productos
    en la plaza, pero los aldeanos temen acabar como el dichoso hijo del molinero./nPuede
    que infle el precio de mis productos.../nPero jam\xE1s vender\xEDa nada maldito."
  childrenIDs:
  - EQ_V.1/7
  - EQ_V.1/8
  - 7
  - 8
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 1042
    y: 133
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 0
  RepPuebloCost: 0
  SobornoCost: 0
